speechtext:
Mr. Speaker, I rise on a point of order. There have been discussions among the House Leaders and 1 think you will find general agreement to the following proposition:
That the vote on the business before the House be deferred until 6 p.m.
Wednesday, tomorrow:
That it has been agreed that there will be no quorum calls by Members of
the House during the process of the rest of debate;
That there will be no need to force a recorded division;
That it has been understood that that recorded division will be at 6 p.m.,
Wednesday, and;
That when no other speaker seeks the floor the House will be adjourned
until 2 p.m. Wednesday next.
